already, or do not wish to be listed. (*This acknowledgement is optional.*)\n\nSome tools (Benchling, per the issue) write the Clustal header as a single word, `CLUSTALW`, rather than `CLUSTAL W`. Both the `Bio.AlignIO` and `Bio.Align` Clustal parsers reject that with `ValueError: CLUSTALW is not a known CLUSTAL header`.\n\nThis adds `CLUSTALW` to the known-program list in both parsers, as suggested in the issue discussion, with a test for each.\n\nTested: the two new tests fail on master and pass with the change; `test_AlignIO_ClustalIO`, `test_Align_clustal`, `test_AlignIO`, `test_SeqIO` pass; `pre-commit` is clean.\n","created_at":"2026-10-07T06:12:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T00:36:57Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09T00:36:57Z","merged_at":"2026-10-09T00:36:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"e38c64daa2433ecf21f596f76287d41122a4a000","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/pulls/5358/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/pulls/5358/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/issues/5358/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/statuses/66663b71f1d6be95babc6a38cbdc66b0af295d07","head":{"label":"Mohit-Ak:fix/clustalw-header","ref":"fix/clustalw-header","sha":"66663b71f1d6be95babc6a38cbdc66b0af295d07","user":{"login":"Mohit-Ak","id":6740115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDAxMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6740115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mohit-Ak","html_url":"https://github.com/Mohit-Ak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mohit-Ak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mohit-Ak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mohit-Ak/gists{/gist_id}","starr